# ============================================================================
#  .gitignore — Muhammad Naqiudin · Portfolio
#  Anything listed here stays on your local machine and is NEVER pushed
#  to GitHub. Only the files that actually make the live website run
#  (index.html, projects.html, style.css, script.js, i18n.js, chatbot.js,
#  assets/, README.md) get published.
# ============================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. archived/ — THE ONE RULE THAT MATTERS
#    Everything not used by the live site now lives in this single folder:
#      archived/old_portfolio/   previous site + full-resolution originals
#      archived/figma-design/    figma.html, figma.css, design PNG, Untitled_*
#      archived/unused-images/   images the new pages don't display
#      archived/resume-source/   the source PDF
#    See archived/README.md. Anything you drop in here is automatically
#    excluded from GitHub — no need to edit this file again.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
archived/
backup/
old_portfolio/
**/archieve/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Safety net — design sources, in case any land back in the project root
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/figma.html
/figma.css
/Untitled_icon/
/Untitled_img/
/Website Portfolio Design.png
*.fig

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Empty leftover folders from the old layout (replaced by assets/)
#    NOTE: assets/img and assets/resume ARE published — only these two
#    top-level folders are skipped.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/image/
/resume/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Documents & archives that should not sit in a public repo
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.docx
*.doc
*.pptx
*.xlsx
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
~$*                 # MS Office lock/temp files (e.g. ~$resume.docx)

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Node / build tooling (in case you later add a bundler)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.next/
.cache/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.env
.env.*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. Editor & OS junk
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 7. Personal notes / scratch files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
push.txt
TODO.txt
notes.md
scratch/

# Any file starting with an underscore is treated as a local draft or test
# page (e.g. _shot.html) and never published.
_*.html
_*.css
_*.js
